[h2]Common Questions[/h2]

[b]Is this the framework?[/b]
Arcane Cores is a content/configuration pack built for Ship Core Framework.

[b]Why is placement blocked?[/b]
The selected profile may restrict size, ownership, block count, or direction. The preview HUD shows the reason and required direction.

[b]Can classes be combined through connectors?[/b]
Some combinations are blacklisted to prevent bonus or limit bypasses.

[b]Does it support multiplayer and subgrids?[/b]
Yes. The framework evaluates the complete mechanical grid group and is designed for multiplayer servers.

[b]Can I reuse these configurations?[/b]
Yes. The data files may be reused as examples. Model use requires credit to Kuvat.

